        "created_at": "2021-01-21T22:14:16.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I also think it would be pretty tough for&nbsp;<em>anyone</em>&nbsp;to keep track of&nbsp;<em>all</em>&nbsp;the Omnitron tech.</p>\n<p>For example, say&nbsp;during one of the Omnitron fights, Legacy's fighting some flying drones and \"thokks\" them out of the sky. They crash down near you hero, and Legacy has to go save some civillians. That's a perfectly reasonable kind of thing to happen.</p>",
